(1, 'Building Technology Architecture', 'BTA (Building Technology Architecture) is a company specializing in innovative construction solutions. With expertise in sustainable design, structural engineering, and advanced building technologies, we deliver cutting-edge projects.', 'key, words, website, web', 'info@sitename.com', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://bta-bd.com/', 1, '<div class=\'text-center\'><img src=\'/assets/frontend/images/maintenance.gif\' width=\'400\'><h1>Website Under Maintenance</h1><h4>Coming Soon</h4></div>', 'https://www.facebook.com/btadhaka', '#', NULL, '#', '#', '#', '#', '#', '#', '#', 'Mahmud Nagar, Ward 66, North Signboard, Demra, Dhaka-1361', '+8801841883887', NULL, NULL, 'info@bta-bd.com', 'Saturday to Thursday 09:00 AM to 06:00 PM', '17509229135396.svg', '17560979405126.png', '17560979403834.png', '#0cbaa4', '#2e3e4e', '#edf3f2', '#dfeae8', 0, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 1, 'footer-bg.webp', 1, '17513639582786.png', 'Why Choose BTA', '<div><h1 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 24px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 42.4px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 44px; font-family: Montserrat; text-transform: capitalize;\">Trusted <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 179, 69);\">Real Estate</span> Experts in Bangladesh</h1></div>', '7+', 'Years of Experience', '5+', 'Successful Projects', 'Expert', 'Investment Support', '<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18px; line-height: 30.6px; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">At <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">BTA</span>, we bring over a decade of experience delivering premium real estate solutions tailored to the unique needs of buyers, investors, and developers. </p>', '/why-choose-us', '17513641159154.png', 'About Our Agency', '<h1 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 24px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 48.4px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 44px; font-family: Montserrat; text-transform: capitalize;\">Your <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 179, 69);\">Trusted Partner</span> in Real Estate in Bangladesh</h1><div dir=\"ltr\"></div>', '<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18px; line-height: 30.6px; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">At <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">BTA</span> , we are a leading real estate agency that specializes in providing comprehensive solutions for all your <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">building and architecture</span> needs. Our team of experts is dedicated to delivering exceptional services in civil solutions, architecture, interior design, equipment services, 3D animation, and IT solutions.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18px; line-height: 30.6px; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">At <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">BTA</span> , we are committed to delivering exceptional quality, innovative solutions, and unmatched customer service. Our goal is to exceed your expectations and build <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">long-lasting partnerships</span>.</p></div>', '/about-us', '17513639583588.png', 'Your trusted agency', 'Building the Future of Smart Living', 'Discover luxury apartments, commercial spaces, and land across Dhaka and beyond tailored to your lifestyle and investment goals.', '/projects', 'Civil Solutions', 'Architect Solutions', 'Interior Design', 'IT Services', 'Your One-Stop Solution for Construction and Engineering', 'Exceptional architectural design services', 'Our team of skilled designers specializes in creating your', 'Smart, secure, and scalable solutions for your digital needs.', '17511153211590.svg', '17511152385412.svg', '17511152385110.svg', '17511152385104.svg', 'info@bta-bd.com', '17512852227556.png', 'Who We Are', '<div><h1 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 24px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 48.4px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 44px; font-family: Montserrat; text-transform: capitalize;\">We are Your Trusted Partner in Real Estate in Bangladesh</h1></div>', '<div><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18px; line-height: 30.6px; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">At Building Technology Architecture (BTA), we specialize in crafting premium real estate developments tailored for the modern lifestyle. Our team brings together architects, civil engineers, and interior experts to build residential and commercial spaces that blend design, functionality, and future-ready technology.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 18px; line-height: 30.6px; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">To be Bangladesh’s most trusted real estate partner for premium developments by delivering projects that offer unmatched quality, transparency, and long-term value.</p></div>', '7+ Years of Experience', '5+ Successful Projects', 'Trusted by Landowners & Investors', 'In-House Architecture, Civil, and Design Team', '17512852721508.svg', '17512854491216.svg', '17512852723842.svg', '17512852727289.svg', 'Civil Solutions:', 'We offer a wide range of civil engineering services to cater to diverse construction projects. Our experienced professionals ensure that every project is meticulously planned, executed, and completed to meet the highest industry standards. From structural design to project management, we provide end-to-end civil solutions that guarantee quality and efficiency.', '17512852985154.png', 'Architecture Solutions:', 'Our architectural solutions are tailored to create functional, aesthetically pleasing spaces that align with your vision and requirements. Our team of skilled architects utilizes cutting-edge technology and industry best practices to deliver innovative designs that stand out. Whether it\'s residential, commercial, or industrial projects, we strive to exceed your expectations.', '17512854499346.png', 'Interior Design:', 'Transforming spaces into inspiring environments is our passion. Our talented interior designers work closely with clients to understand their unique preferences and create personalized interiors that reflect their style. We combine creativity with practicality to ensure a harmonious balance between functionality and aesthetics.', '17512855776128.png', 'Equipment Service:', 'We offer comprehensive equipment services, including installation, maintenance, and repairs. Our skilled technicians are trained to handle a wide range of equipment, ensuring efficient operation and minimizing downtime. With our expertise, you can rely on us to keep your equipment running smoothly.', '17512856486405.png', '3D Animation:', 'Bring your projects to life with our immersive 3D animation services. We utilize advanced technology and techniques to create realistic visualizations, walkthroughs, and flyovers. Whether it\'s showcasing architectural designs or marketing real estate properties, our animations captivate audiences and leave a lasting impression.', '17512856484631.png', 'IT Service:', 'In the digital era, technology plays a vital role in the real estate industry. Our IT services provide reliable and secure solutions to streamline your operations and enhance productivity. From network setup and cybersecurity to software development and automation, we leverage the power of technology to drive your success.', '17512856488764.png', 1, 1, '2025-06-21 08:11:15', '2025-08-25 02:59:00');
